/*
 * Review of e112c6a: intentionally retain baldur-skin-thermal.dtsi unchanged.
 * The proposed deletion of map2/map5/map8/map10 removes all GPU cooling
 * driven by the board NTC (44/46/48/50 C). A 105 C GPU junction trip does not
 * replace enclosure-temperature protection. CPU throttling alone and Android
 * game-profile claims do not establish a safe sustained GPU power envelope.
 * No board thermal measurements are available for this port in this review.
 * Keep this last include as a policy note; it makes no device-tree changes.
 */
